{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB飲食資訊綜藝《美食強人》明晚（26日）播出的第六集，是主題美食「海南雞飯」下半集，星級食評家是肥媽及周奕瑋。</p><p>挑戰「海南雞飯」GBA評級的四間餐廳，談到叫價接近400港元海南雞飯，幟哥、胡孟青及肥媽看法各有不同！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:03.354910+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:55:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:06.093740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.798660+00:00","content_hash":"c1b66d419477d02484b8a126a229a26ecbeac2ff506055f4ae054a9b7caafa8c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}